BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Youth Hub: Design Your Own T-Shirt
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20261119T160000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20261119T180000
UID:6ab438e3101eb7003f3271a7@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Become a Fashion Designer!\nExpress your personal style and cr
 eate a custom text or graphic for your T-shirt using\nCricut technology.\n
 Bring it to life in Cricut Design Space\, then use a professional heat pre
 ss to fuse your unique design permanently into the fabric.\nThis program i
