 ovided.\nThis workshop is part of the Teen Social Health and Wellness prog
 ramming. Generously supported by The Estate of Claudia Krawchuk.\nFor ages
  13-17. Space is limited\; registration required.\nFood Allergy Notice:\n
 Please be aware that food will be used in this program. Certain food ingre
 dients may cause allergic reactions in some people.\nInformation Collectio
 n Notice:\nThe personal information on this form is collected by the Toron
