 o perilous dungeons and thwart evil plots in an on-going Dungeons & Dragon
 s campaign!\nThis is an ongoing adventure at an intermediate level. Player
 s will need to have a character sheet prepared for fifth level.\nSpace is 
 limited to six players\, but guests and spectators are also welcome!\nThis
  program is part of Youth Hub service. Youth Hubs are a welcoming place fo
 r teens after school and in the summer\, where helpful staff are always av
 ailable. Free\, nutritious snacks are offered daily. Drop by a branch wi
 th a\nYouth Hub\nor call the branch to find out more.
LOCATION:Maria A. Shchuka\, Youth Hub
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/6ac7cd62fee2d21deb21f74b
X-SOURCE:Toronto Public Library — Teens
END:VEVENT
