UID:6a85e0fb2d60e40d5b5b624b@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Engage your creativity through the art of cookie decorating wi
 th Jasper Bryan\, an expressive arts therapist. This program is a welcomin
 g\, hands-on activity that introduces you to the arts and builds community
 . Participants will receive all the supplies needed to design their own un
 ique cookie while having fun connecting with others and expressing themsel
 ves.​\nFood allergy notice\n: Please be aware that food will be used in 
 this program. Food products used in this program may contain or may have c
 ome into contact with common allergens. (*Contains dairy\, sugar\, and caf
 feine)\n*Registration Required. Space is limited.\nRegister online or call
  416-396-8872.\nRegistration opens November 2\, 2026\n.\n*\nSpecial guest 
 for the\nFriday Teen Social program.\nInformation Collection Notice:\nThe 
 personal information on this form is collected by the Toronto Public Libra
 ry under the Public Libraries Act\, sections 20(a)\, 20(c)\, and 20(d). Th
 e information will only be used for event and program registration\, deliv
 ery and evaluation. Questions about how the library handles your informati
 on can be directed to Answerline staff at answerline@tpl.ca\, 416-397-5981
 \, 789 Yonge Street\, Toronto ON M4W 2G8
LOCATION:Guildwood
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/6a85e0fb2d60e40d5b5b624b
