 creen. Whether you're a first-time viewer or long-time fan\, these movies 
 are sure to please.\nOctober 22: Aliens (1986\, 14+)\nOctober 29: Scream 
 (1996\, 18A)\nNovember 5: Knives Out: Glass Onion (2022\, PG)\nNovember 1
 2: Hitch (2005\, PG-13)\nNovember 19: Forrest Gump (1994\, PG)\nNovember 2
 6: The Shawshank Redemption (1994\, 14A)\nAll are welcome. Drop-in\, no r
 egistration required.
LOCATION:High Park\, Program Room
