DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20261116T180000
UID:6aa1b2d58cf597003f925245@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:During this comprehensive 4-week course​\, participants lear
 n essential deejaying skills such as song selection and mixing\, working w
 ith volume and tempo\, understanding deejay terminology\, and using effect
 s and samples. ​ Led by Deejay Vee.\nParticipants will understand how to
