 loring storytelling as a persuasive tool\, crafting compelling narratives\
 , and delivering impactful elevator pitches that leave a lasting impressio
 n.\nRegistration required. Limited spots. Young Adults (ages 18-24) have p
 riority for this workshop.\nThis program will be taking place in the\nFoun
 der's Room\n\,\nlocated on the first floor (past the staircase\, down the 
