 their or their family’s bank account. Scholarships\, grants\, and bursar
 ies are available for high school\, college\, and university students\, an
 d you don’t need perfect grades! This presentation will help empower att
 endees with information to find and win money for postsecondary education.
 \nThis program is part of Youth Hub service. Youth Hubs are a welcoming pl
 ace for teens after school and in the summer\, where helpful staff are alw
 ays available. Free\, nutritious snacks are offered daily. Drop by a bra
