 ple embroidered lavender flower on a piece of linen. Then\, sew the embroi
 dery into a small lavender sachet to create your own pleasant lightly scen
 ted piece. All materials will be provided.\nPlease note\, there is limited
  space. Arrive early to ensure your spot.\nThis program is part of Youth H
 ub service. Youth Hubs are a welcoming place for teens after school and in
